<includeonly>|-
! colspan="2" class="source-semanticschemas-section-header" | {{#if:{{{label|}}}|{{{label}}}|{{#show:Category:{{{category|}}}|?Display label|default={{{category|}}}}}}}</includeonly><noinclude>
Renders the header row for a SemanticSchemas category display table.
Shows the category's display label (or name as fallback).

Visual styling (background, alignment) lives in
`resources/ext.semanticschemas.basecontent.css` keyed off the
`source-semanticschemas-section-header` class.

Parameters:
* category - The category name (without namespace prefix). Required.
* label    - Optional baked display label. When set, skips the
             `#show:Category:X|?Display label` lookup. Auto-generated
             dispatcher templates pass this.
</noinclude>
